  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventive Initiative Focusing Children from Risks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative will help children in their learning by starting a coaching class at 6 different villages in central but geographically challenging, hilly areas for 180 children. At this coaching place, children will get help in their academic and mainly developing self-capacity to speak up for their needs and capable of making the right decision by ignoring barriers created intentionally and by the situation. This initiative is expected to be a model one.</narrative>
  </description>
